---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Art from '../components/Art.astro';
import { themes } from '../data/projects';
---
<Base title="handism — Three ways to tell a story">
  <header class="chooser-nav"><a class="wordmark" href="/">handism<span>®</span></a><span class="mono">PORTFOLIO / DESIGN STUDIES</span><a href="https://github.com/handism" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a></header>
  <main id="main" class="chooser-main">
    <div class="chooser-intro"><p class="eyebrow">ONE CREATOR. THREE PERSPECTIVES.</p><h1>Same curiosity.<br/><span>Different worlds.</span></h1><div class="chooser-description"><p>ひとつの好奇心。3つの見せ方。</p><p>色、余白、動き。それぞれの世界を、体験してみてください。</p></div></div>
    <div class="concepts">{themes.map((theme, i) => <a href={`/${theme.id}/`} class={`concept concept-${theme.id}`}><div class="concept-preview"><Art type={['orbit', 'flower', 'portal'][i]} /><span class="concept-letter">{theme.letter}</span><span class="concept-enter">↗</span>{i === 0 ? <h2>Midnight<br/><em>Lab.</em></h2> : i === 1 ? <h2>The<br/><em>Edit.</em></h2> : <h2>Elsewhere<span>好奇心の、その先へ。</span></h2>}</div><div class="concept-info"><div><span class="mono">CONCEPT {theme.letter}</span><h3>{theme.ja}</h3><p>{theme.description}</p></div><span class="concept-arrow">↗</span></div><p class="concept-tags mono">{theme.tags}</p></a>)}</div>
    <div class="chooser-note"><span class="status-dot"></span><p>同じ4つのプロジェクトを、異なるレイアウトとモーションで。<br class="mobile-only"/>各デモ下部のバーから、いつでも切り替えられます。</p></div>
  </main>
  <footer class="chooser-footer"><span>HANDISM © 2026</span><span>Built with curiosity, and Astro.</span><span>DESIGN EXPLORATION — 01</span></footer>
</Base>
